  "segments": [
    {
      "start_time": 6.483,
      "end_time": 7.513,
      "text": "我们家孩子也是。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 16.209,
      "end_time": 19.469,
      "text": "哎，您好，请问一下这是你们谁丢的鸭子啊？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 19.629,
      "end_time": 20.589,
      "text": "哎，这是我丢的。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 29.293,
      "end_time": 30.133,
      "text": "听话听话听话。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 36.707,
      "end_time": 40.677,
      "text": "妈妈的同事小蚂蚁来了，还推着一车礼物。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 41.347,
      "end_time": 42.347,
      "text": "一车礼物？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 42.847,
      "end_time": 44.847,
      "text": "对，可能还是好吃的。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 45.787,
      "end_time": 46.707,
      "text": "就知道吃。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 47.147,
      "end_time": 49.547,
      "text": "那怎么了？人家正是长身体的时候。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 49.547,
      "end_time": 53.027,
      "text": "刘姐，你看这临时通知加班，我又找不到人看他。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 53.507,
      "end_time": 54.987,
      "text": "所以啊，只好麻烦你了啊。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 54.987,
      "end_time": 57.307,
      "text": "哎呦，你放心吧，我特别喜欢带小孩。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 57.307,
      "end_time": 57.787,
      "text": "真的？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 59.147,
      "end_time": 59.947,
      "text": "好久都没带了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 127.836,
      "end_time": 129.836,
      "text": "妈妈一会儿就回来。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 132.756,
      "end_time": 133.836,
      "text": "今儿你可有事干了啊。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 134.956,
      "end_time": 136.156,
      "text": "你看这孩子多好玩。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 137.516,
      "end_time": 139.356,
      "text": "小乖乖，叫爸爸。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 139.916,
      "end_time": 140.636,
      "text": "爸爸。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 142.076,
      "end_time": 144.156,
      "text": "哎呦，现在看着好家伙。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 144.636,
      "end_time": 146.796,
      "text": "弄这么个孩子可真够费劲的。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 146.796,
      "end_time": 148.236,
      "text": "这哪天能长大？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 149.116,
      "end_time": 151.676,
      "text": "替人看半天，你操这心干嘛？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 152.556,
      "end_time": 154.316,
      "text": "哎，想想咱家那仨。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 154.796,
      "end_time": 158.236,
      "text": "好家伙，都是从这么大一天一天弄起来的。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 158.636,
      "end_time": 161.116,
      "text": "多费劲呢，幸亏长大喽。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 161.756,
      "end_time": 164.316,
      "text": "幸亏长大喽，睡觉觉啊。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 170.553,
      "end_time": 170.873,
      "text": "喂。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 170.953,
      "end_time": 171.353,
      "text": "喂。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 171.593,
      "end_time": 172.073,
      "text": "啊是我。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 172.233,
      "end_time": 172.953,
      "text": "啊我是。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 173.193,
      "end_time": 174.793,
      "text": "是吗？好好好，我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 175.113,
      "end_time": 176.073,
      "text": "哦好，明白了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 176.073,
      "end_time": 177.033,
      "text": "我马上来马上来。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 177.113,
      "end_time": 177.833,
      "text": "啊我这就来。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 178.633,
      "end_time": 179.273,
      "text": "我团里有事。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 179.273,
      "end_time": 179.913,
      "text": "哎呦我又。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 180.0,
      "end_time": 180.81,
      "text": "你找我？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 180.95,
      "end_time": 181.76,
      "text": "赶紧赶紧赶紧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 191.324,
      "end_time": 192.394,
      "text": "我和妈妈有急事。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 192.434,
      "end_time": 193.434,
      "text": "现在我们要出去。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 193.514,
      "end_time": 194.284,
      "text": "拜拜。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 194.604,
      "end_time": 196.894,
      "text": "嘿，拜什么拜，我这还没说完呢。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 197.064,
      "end_time": 198.974,
      "text": "哎呀，您就放心吧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 199.164,
      "end_time": 201.994,
      "text": "我们三个人经常自己在家，别担心别担心。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 201.994,
      "end_time": 203.654,
      "text": "就是的，有什么可担心的。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 204.384,
      "end_time": 205.544,
      "text": "我是担心你们吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 206.024,
      "end_time": 207.384,
      "text": "我是担心他。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 208.234,
      "end_time": 209.994,
      "text": "啊，原来是他呀。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 210.034,
      "end_time": 211.154,
      "text": "嗯，不就是他嘛。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 211.234,
      "end_time": 213.384,
      "text": "哎，你们谁爱推走谁推走，我没意见。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 215.194,
      "end_time": 216.414,
      "text": "嘿，瞧你说的。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 216.524,
      "end_time": 218.474,
      "text": "爸妈出去办事哪能带着他呀。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 218.514,
      "end_time": 219.524,
      "text": "就是。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 219.524,
      "end_time": 221.004,
      "text": "你看还是小雪懂事吧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 221.004,
      "end_time": 222.354,
      "text": "大几岁就是不一样。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 222.834,
      "end_time": 224.194,
      "text": "那您想把他送哪去啊？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 224.234,
      "end_time": 225.874,
      "text": "您给我地址我帮您送也行啊。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 226.204,
      "end_time": 226.514,
      "text": "可以。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 227.244,
      "end_time": 229.234,
      "text": "哪儿也不能去，就在咱们家。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 229.964,
      "end_time": 232.584,
      "text": "他爸爸出差了，妈妈今天加班没办法。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 233.084,
      "end_time": 233.714,
      "text": "就在咱们家。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 234.664,
      "end_time": 236.184,
      "text": "那送给姥姥家呢？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 236.834,
      "end_time": 237.794,
      "text": "姥姥没在家。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 238.424,
      "end_time": 239.674,
      "text": "那送爷爷家呢？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 240.0,
      "end_time": 241.24,
      "text": "爷爷出门了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 241.68,
      "end_time": 242.52,
      "text": "那我们就..."
    },
    {
      "start_time": 242.08,
      "end_time": 243.2,
      "text": "什么也甭想了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 243.68,
      "end_time": 245.76,
      "text": "孩子必须留在咱们家，明白吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 245.76,
      "end_time": 246.88,
      "text": "我和妈妈必须出门。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 247.52,
      "end_time": 250.64,
      "text": "嗨，说了半天不就是让我们看着他吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 251.12,
      "end_time": 252.32,
      "text": "没问题，交给我们。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 252.64,
      "end_time": 254.08,
      "text": "我们仨看一个，白玩儿。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 256.0,
      "end_time": 257.12,
      "text": "看孩子能叫玩吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 257.36,
      "end_time": 259.92,
      "text": "我告诉你啊，你们可不能乱玩，知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 260.16,
      "end_time": 262.08,
      "text": "看小孩这个事责任重大。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 262.4,
      "end_time": 265.28,
      "text": "你们呀，必须不能把他磕着碰着。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 265.28,
      "end_time": 267.44,
      "text": "哎呀呀呀呀，妈妈妈妈，行了行了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 267.68,
      "end_time": 269.68,
      "text": "他连道都不会走呢，摔不着他。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 271.12,
      "end_time": 271.36,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 272.72,
      "end_time": 273.04,
      "text": "那成。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 273.76,
      "end_time": 274.64,
      "text": "那你们记住了啊。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 275.04,
      "end_time": 277.76,
      "text": "如果他要是哭，就说明饿了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 277.76,
      "end_time": 278.64,
      "text": "给点奶吃就行了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 279.6,
      "end_time": 281.84,
      "text": "如果吃完奶还哭，再给他点奶吃。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 282.4,
      "end_time": 283.84,
      "text": "如果他还哭，再吃。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 285.12,
      "end_time": 285.84,
      "text": "哭了就喂。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 286.4,
      "end_time": 287.44,
      "text": "喂了还哭还喂。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 287.6,
      "end_time": 288.56,
      "text": "喂了还哭还喂。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 289.68,
      "end_time": 291.04,
      "text": "那你不把他给撑死啊？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 292.24,
      "end_time": 292.8,
      "text": "能吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 296.56,
      "end_time": 297.36,
      "text": "哎，宝贝，快。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 297.92,
      "end_time": 298.8,
      "text": "哎哎，夏东海。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 299.6,
      "end_time": 299.92,
      "text": "你说..."
    },
    {
      "start_time": 360.089,
      "end_time": 363.119,
      "text": "哎，小雨，看。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 363.659,
      "end_time": 365.449,
      "text": "是不是看这个很亲切呀？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 365.769,
      "end_time": 367.829,
      "text": "是不是去年还在用啊？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 376.149,
      "end_time": 377.619,
      "text": "哎呀，别闹了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 377.799,
      "end_time": 379.589,
      "text": "你看你们都把他吵醒了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 383.239,
      "end_time": 384.869,
      "text": "这这这这这怎么办啊？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 385.589,
      "end_time": 386.819,
      "text": "我哪知道啊？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 387.029,
      "end_time": 389.089,
      "text": "我只见大人抱着他哄呢。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 389.769,
      "end_time": 391.549,
      "text": "这这怎么抱啊？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 394.939,
      "end_time": 395.849,
      "text": "行行行行。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 396.979,
      "end_time": 398.559,
      "text": "可是拍多大劲儿啊？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 399.579,
      "end_time": 400.299,
      "text": "不知道。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 401.219,
      "end_time": 401.639,
      "text": "小东西。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 406.329,
      "end_time": 409.049,
      "text": "刘星，你想要铁砂掌拍他呀？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 409.379,
      "end_time": 410.259,
      "text": "你想拍死他。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 411.789,
      "end_time": 413.139,
      "text": "那怎么办呀这？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 413.629,
      "end_time": 415.249,
      "text": "哎呀，还是让我来吧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 415.249,
      "end_time": 416.409,
      "text": "我来我来。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 418.259,
      "end_time": 419.919,
      "text": "我见到你很高兴。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 420.0,
      "end_time": 422.16,
      "text": "没反应吧。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 422.16,
      "end_time": 423.95,
      "text": "耐心耐心，等会儿。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 425.872,
      "end_time": 428.312,
      "text": "我是海龟靓仔夏雨。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 428.752,
      "end_time": 433.232,
      "text": "虽说海龟很多，靓仔也很多，"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 433.792,
      "end_time": 438.752,
      "text": "但是像我这样又海龟又靓仔的人是很少的。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 440.496,
      "end_time": 442.256,
      "text": "认识我是你的荣幸。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 443.936,
      "end_time": 446.416,
      "text": "哼，这叫误导零岁儿童。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 448.496,
      "end_time": 448.816,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 451.216,
      "end_time": 451.696,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 453.216,
      "end_time": 455.856,
      "text": "哈哈，怎么样？睡着了吧？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 456.256,
      "end_time": 460.656,
      "text": "是我带磁性的声音让他进入了甜美的梦乡。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 465.936,
      "end_time": 470.336,
      "text": "嘿！我说怎么找不着你们俩了呢，"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 470.336,
      "end_time": 472.096,
      "text": "原来跑这儿休闲来了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 473.456,
      "end_time": 477.456,
      "text": "哎哟，小孩都吃饱喝足了，我们大人也应该歇会儿。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 477.456,
      "end_time": 480.016,
      "text": "就是，都吃饱喝..."
    },
    {
      "start_time": 480.043,
      "end_time": 481.893,
      "text": "喝足睡着了还让我们看呢。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 483.863,
      "end_time": 485.813,
      "text": "你们觉得自己挺有理是不是啊？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 486.673,
      "end_time": 487.723,
      "text": "那是。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 488.573,
      "end_time": 490.513,
      "text": "你看人小孩多容易呀。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 491.233,
      "end_time": 491.833,
      "text": "真是。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 493.113,
      "end_time": 494.113,
      "text": "吃饱了就睡，"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 494.493,
      "end_time": 497.653,
      "text": "也不吵着出去玩，也不闹着让咱给他讲故事。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 497.853,
      "end_time": 498.253,
      "text": "对呀。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 499.463,
      "end_time": 502.183,
      "text": "哎呀，可能我小时候就是这样，"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 502.493,
      "end_time": 504.473,
      "text": "这么乖，哼，不让家长操心。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 505.383,
      "end_time": 507.953,
      "text": "我小时候也是这样，是个乖乖仔。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 509.533,
      "end_time": 512.023,
      "text": "就你俩现在这样，还还乖乖仔呢？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 513.403,
      "end_time": 518.183,
      "text": "要说我小时候嘛，是个乖乖女倒差不多。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 523.613,
      "end_time": 524.513,
      "text": "小青蛙在叫。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 525.543,
      "end_time": 529.683,
      "text": "什么呀？那个乖乖仔好像醒了。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 601.523,
      "end_time": 606.083,
      "text": "刘星，我觉得吧，这种事还是你比较合适。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 606.083,
      "end_time": 606.403,
      "text": "来来来，你来。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 606.403,
      "end_time": 608.323,
      "text": "我一男人我没干过这个。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 608.793,
      "end_time": 612.643,
      "text": "刘星，我一直以为你是一个心灵手巧的男生。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 612.643,
      "end_time": 614.083,
      "text": "所以我觉得还是你比较合适。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 614.083,
      "end_time": 615.043,
      "text": "来来来，你比较合适。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 615.043,
      "end_time": 615.683,
      "text": "来来来来来。"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 617.363,
      "end_time": 619.203,
      "text": "哎呀，不就换块破尿布吗？"
    },
    {
      "start_time": 622.083,
      "end_time": 624.003,
      "text": "换就换，拿个新的来。"
